Brief_1_1=Welcome to the Expansion simulation, commander! Here you will learn the basics of portal and unicorn management, as well as harvesting resources and protecting against attacks.
Brief_1_2=If you missed part of the message, you can read it again in the log of the latest messages in the game menu or with the F8 key.
Brief_1_3=To close a message immediately, use the Spacebar button. To skip all messages in the dialog queue, use the Enter button
Brief_1_4=To begin with, move your arrows or WASD on the map. Near to the portal is a unicorn and a crystal. Select the unicorn with a cursor or frame and send it to the crystal through the RMB. Tasks can be find in the game menu or with the F5 key.
Brief_2=Okay, unicorn near the crystal. This is a resource for harvesting magic. Research the unicorn's ability to harvest by clicking on the icon. The action will take a little time, but immediately after the unicorn will begin to mine the resource if it is close enough.
Brief_3=Great, you started harvesting magic from the crystal. Continue and harvest 100 magic.
Brief_4=Now you have enough resources to teleport a new unicorn from the portal. Select a portal and use the Teleport a unicorn action.
Brief_5_1=Great, you have two unicorns. We must protect the portal from hostile life forms. Research the ability of a horn laser from unicorns and prepare to repel an attack.
Brief_5_2=I displayed a timer, how long is left until the wave of enemies. In real conditions, this will not always be predictable.
Brief_5_3=Just as a unicorn with the ability to harvest magic will itself harvest resources from nearby crystals, a unicorn with the ability to horn laser will attack nearby enemies.
Brief_7_1=Great, the aggressive creatures that attacked the portal were destroyed. Keep harvesting magic and collect 500 magic. Let me remind you that the goal of Expansion is, first of all, to extract resources for the prosperity of unicorns.
Brief_7_2=To speed up harvesting, the second unicorn can also research the harvesting ability and approach the crystal. You can also teleport another unicorn; in the simulation you have no more than three available.
Brief_8_1=Super, you completed all the required simulation tasks. You can interrupt it with the Escape/F10 key or continue exploring the simulation in free mode.
Brief_8_2=If you wish, you can spend a little magic research the ability of the healing. Like all other actions, it is performed automatically, near a wounded unicorn. It is important that the unicorn cannot heal itself.
Brief_8_3=You can also explore the surrounding area in search of additional crystals. Be prepared to face enemies, there are many dangers in the lands of Expansion. Some enemies can only be overcome by a group of unicorns.
Task_Moving=Send the unicorn to the crystal
Task_MakeHarvest=Research the harvest of magic
Task_Harvest=Harvest 100 magic
Task_MakeUnicorn=Teleport a new unicorn from the portal
Task_Battle=Research the horn laser for unicorns and repel the attack on the portal
Task_HarvestFinal=Harvest 500 magic
